    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1095839d42460aa5f84415",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿！但也是因为实力增强了才能优胜的，\\n所以也是训练员的功劳喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d8d3f1e386192f9e4dd9e01a324553220c4b221401eb49d83bcdfb8cc5c996",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "926"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e153f7f187ee0af9cff860",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场胜利是多亏了风水才赢得的……\\n能让大家明白这件事的话我会很开心的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d06683781a4c8086a014c219443ab84c2c14c5e6540c5c24378ecb85e3b76b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "927"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e50a43ff293079cf04c988",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿！但也是因为实力增强了才能优胜的，\\n所以也是训练员的功劳喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d8d3f1e386192f9e4dd9e01a324553220c4b221401eb49d83bcdfb8cc5c996",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "928"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43eb75da1c20f804303fe4b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场胜利是多亏了风水才赢得的……\\n能让大家明白这件事的话我会很开心的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d06683781a4c8086a014c219443ab84c2c14c5e6540c5c24378ecb85e3b76b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "929"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d7c7eb7420e4541f953f636",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是！我应该有做到冷静跑完──啊！\\n唔唔，抱歉……我还不太习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b425262b4df0e14460471b0bb3aee20b230b4269f6d83b436c8252bd764206ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818d0de16fdd1011705228f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Thank you，ありがとう，merci。\\n我用各种语言表达我的感谢啰。嗯哼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c887d3db24e2cef61ac48266dda30073de77676a1e06a9c886cfbcd56853ad6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "930"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d8352974c615ce96396496",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把愿望都注入在小真娃娃上了。成效就是\\n大家看到的这样。你家要不要也摆一个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "309c991aefd2d76f49fc6bf3174cfb62b4a09dc3629dee6481ba1fae2e19c112",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "931"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:258a685cd7bdfe8f0880e9b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会把晨间练跑的时间提早一点点。\\n如果看到睡眼惺忪的小真，要叫醒我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0919e150fa45cda1f424f4575e54c78cfd2f6f1d3976002659abb9932716a032",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "932"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:232c6306a3bb83641a55077a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～♪这真是令人开心呢。\\n可以再更～目不转睛地看着我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16382fda4e5566d39191cfafa8cd0e7c669f69d1c6da08c135a22debe35b6da7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "933"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb40cb2b5d2c0129d7a44261",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家都有好好看着小真吗？\\n除了眨眼以外，都不能移开目光喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f363b58d6d3bc18052a9d97728ffb1460d281f105474bce8b060d9a4a29a65b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "934"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48b0247576f227723c74e0f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会把晨间练跑的时间提早一点点。\\n如果看到睡眼惺忪的小真，要叫醒我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0919e150fa45cda1f424f4575e54c78cfd2f6f1d3976002659abb9932716a032",
