    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02346d73d3145e9bf691079",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能设立一个光滑的小真雕像。\\n欢迎大家都来可以「摸摸头」的旅游景点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c64eb55d9738901a16107ef11291ea37c62deb08d61dd12fdadc25f0d3f547",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "938"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5a025f4015be8b863ab2c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是妈妈。但她应该还没看才对。\\n所以在她打电话来之前都要「嘘～」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "318eb1416d0177f113cf59d5b48fb4ecd559123786fc3eb2d4b28cabf778d63e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "939"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89f4d34f6f7777cabf38c90e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我想想喔……我喜欢的作者要出新书了，\\n我打算去买那本和一些旧书，还有──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02390b57e7ac68908fd7c5c08911694fdddad6ae1e6946032e292d8567a180c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d436d3ff24430c231498cc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能设立一个光滑的小真雕像。\\n欢迎大家都来可以「摸摸头」的旅游景点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c64eb55d9738901a16107ef11291ea37c62deb08d61dd12fdadc25f0d3f547",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "940"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:736374aff37167c1fa946f1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是妈妈。但她应该还没看才对。\\n所以在她打电话来之前都要「嘘～」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "318eb1416d0177f113cf59d5b48fb4ecd559123786fc3eb2d4b28cabf778d63e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "941"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e727c4ba38255b207faac786",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "圆滚滚跟绿豆，还有乱蓬蓬……\\n啊，它们是我在森林里的好朋友。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb31ca498d1b0d99d58ee5d6571dcdf6ec8286944e79427c81de639f02a1bbe9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "942"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69dff78c8ddeb97b9193dda2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想应该有成为飓风吧……呵呵，但因为\\n风是无法掌握的，所以也很难分享感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70c8244c4d54edeb51f4329d3cb6ba2e202c1f230f3592e077db0be60e153d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "943"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeaa38e389cb3db931595514",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "集中精神……？啊，我当时其实是在感受\\n和煦的风，不过好像也可以这样解读没错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a848396c98a7277c2b036324bc7d307b7f8ec531ee827b9ae4757bddb748103",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "944"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:775c9b7c027c78b260f5b781",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这里是最能感受到凉风的地方。\\n同时，还能听清楚随风而来的欢呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f45515a3803156e2b073ca547f318cab423ef4aa6afc6e99be080f55ee2cc0a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "945"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94dd092d530aa09a30bc6972",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然很开心。\\n就像是被风筝到空中漂浮的感觉喔。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "149e825a13e8d886c85955028bdeb215729257ae058631d7d271bb73a77a0266",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "946"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e2c09324a5eaaf935d00526",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "集中精神……？啊，我当时其实是在感受\\n和煦的风，不过好像也可以这样解读没错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a848396c98a7277c2b036324bc7d307b7f8ec531ee827b9ae4757bddb748103",
