      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5f4a742597148dcc822ba06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总觉得气氛？磁场？超猛的，吓到我了。\\n但好像也多亏这样才让我认真了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64dab3656afc70b2e4c413ad23e091dae0d44aa2da67d8658e3eb4f3dc15981",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8155aa3ec76eb4782fae4a24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有感受到我带来的风吗？\\n我也觉得自己的表现就像真的成为风一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fad914490a719cc747c763bce271019d01575813e599ab80f02640a805aca56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "950"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5642d4b4aa071d4c95306190",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多亏有对手们扬起的暴风和训练员的暖风，\\n才促使着我往前冲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b79406ccf70be70e9978a936764a44f010f313826f820361b2f6d0a46dc306",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "951"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d63629b42cd0f550eb54bde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有感受到我带来的风吗？\\n我也觉得自己的表现就像真的成为风一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fad914490a719cc747c763bce271019d01575813e599ab80f02640a805aca56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "952"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c83ad302a4b89db3e7966e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多亏有对手们扬起的暴风和训练员的暖风，\\n才促使着我往前冲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b79406ccf70be70e9978a936764a44f010f313826f820361b2f6d0a46dc306",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "953"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91959d5e36fee648ed01b0b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的平衡感很好。\\n或许跟这也有关系吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "655ea8f53859a5d8b8d446b8b28e594562bbee932399800115aab098f881e3a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "954"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d96f841a72e9462228be09f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢你们总是为我加油。你们给我的信，\\n我都会一一回覆，请再等等喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df260abd698002ebeeb7d8ecc5c84f6afa5eb315658e0556077decd7fdc4fc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "955"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbcb9026094bc754e3efe7b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这应该是受到我爸爸的影响吧。\\n我从小就常常看他做出一些很厉害的步法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbed5964bb22e3b8e01e9fee36a0f118e973726fd13c15002fce855ab5bf86a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c94e36ecd7f2321ba1979e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是用「智慧型手机」看的东西吧？\\n可以借我看一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e743565b5370eca0f1346afc676082de0f0693bd052cc5150f72738443b58aa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "957"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc15fd83185650fd63ee5c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我炖了萝卜，\\n所以准备回去跟宿舍的大家一起吃喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "572af5637409d884a9ef8b299496ea4729dbddaf9d7883f4d629d10e6c3b656c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "958"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:398c14559eebf18e17c8a431",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这应该是受到我爸爸的影响吧。\\n我从小就常常看他做出一些很厉害的步法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbed5964bb22e3b8e01e9fee36a0f118e973726fd13c15002fce855ab5bf86a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "959"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284c73e9b1d52be37c0d95e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想想～好像有跟我说过，但我忘了……\\n是说，就算记得也不能把作战讲出来吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5126f99d139efd45010f9a69484f61b4de10ff21c80aff2811a8a2ee94291247",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e7a202a21c3fe74fe76a05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是用「智慧型手机」看的东西吧？\\n可以借我看一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e743565b5370eca0f1346afc676082de0f0693bd052cc5150f72738443b58aa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "960"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1acdb64a0193321878f6a671",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我炖了萝卜，\\n所以准备回去跟宿舍的大家一起吃喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "572af5637409d884a9ef8b299496ea4729dbddaf9d7883f4d629d10e6c3b656c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "961"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3795f2e6d783e61054b569ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的是很盛大的欢呼声呢～！\\n吓得我还以为自己要腿软了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd5244ebf9197ce398e55c46183588d2427b0e309cbf5e4822f45b29a2b3c41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "962"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac94461348bf2bdb226b69b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……无论什么事，都别放弃坚持去做吧。\\n只要持续努力，就一定会有好事发生的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1d1786c16acd7e15e11577ad2d195910216d5e1634a696ce6ad5f02b129c9b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "963"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:400a28a1435fe58bbeb312b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的是很盛大的欢呼声呢～！\\n吓得我还以为自己要腿软了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd5244ebf9197ce398e55c46183588d2427b0e309cbf5e4822f45b29a2b3c41",
